Embedding a file ends its operation; a new link target drops /Dest.

pdf_add_embedded_file began an operation and never ended it on
success; the journal stayed inside it and later undo, redo or
state reads threw (Ely attachments).

pdf_set_link_uri wrote /A but kept an old /Dest, which readers
take first; the link kept its old target (Ely link editing).

--- a/source/pdf/pdf-link.c	2026-10-06 15:47:19
+++ b/source/pdf/pdf-link.c	2026-10-06 15:47:47
@@ -506,6 +506,7 @@
 		}
 
 		filespec = pdf_add_filespec(ctx, doc, filename, file);
+		pdf_end_operation(ctx, doc);
 	}
 	fz_always(ctx)
 		pdf_drop_obj(ctx, file);
@@ -630,6 +631,7 @@
 	{
 		pdf_dict_put_drop(ctx, link->obj, PDF_NAME(A),
 				pdf_new_action_from_link(ctx, link->page->doc, uri));
+		pdf_dict_del(ctx, link->obj, PDF_NAME(Dest));
 		fz_free(ctx, link->super.uri);
 		link->super.uri = fz_strdup(ctx, uri);
 		pdf_end_operation(ctx, link->page->doc);
